{#- Hero (BrokerFlo-style, Raffi 2026-10-29): full-bleed photo or video under a navy scrim, a tag chip,
    the page's only <h1>, ONE subheadline, two actions, and the proof strip (key figures) on its bottom
    edge. Pulls itself up under the transparent sticky header. Styles: styles/sections/hero.css
    Data: c.hero.{eyebrow, title, lead, cta?, image, imageAlt, variant?, video?}, c.stats (proof strip),
          c.ui.{cta, phoneLabel, video.{pause, play, placeholder}}, c.form.id, site.company.{phone, phoneHref}.
    Media variants: c.hero.variant "image" (A, default) or "video" (B). B needs c.hero.video
    { src, poster, placeholder? }: muted, looped, started by scripts/sections/hero-video.js (never
    under reduced motion), with a visible pause button (WCAG 2.2.2). In preview builds every page with
    a hero.video also gets a /video/ twin so both variants can be compared (src/_data/landings.js).
    Variant A's image is the LCP element: eager + fetchpriority high, and preloaded in layouts/base.njk
    with the SAME sizes string (keep both in sync). -#}
{%- from "components/ui.njk" import button -%}
{%- set variant = "video" if (c.hero.variant == "video" and c.hero.video) else "image" -%}
<section class="section section--dark hero hero--{{ variant }}" id="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero__media">
    {%- if variant == "video" %}
    <video class="hero__video" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="{{ ('/assets/' + c.hero.video.poster) | url }}" data-hero-video>
      <source src="{{ ('/assets/' + c.hero.video.src) | url }}" type="video/{{ 'webm' if c.hero.video.src.endsWith('.webm') else 'mp4' }}">
    </video>
    {%- else %}
    {% picture c.hero.image, c.hero.imageAlt | plain, "100vw", { loading: "eager", fetchpriority: "high", class: "hero__img" } %}
    {%- endif %}
  </div>

  <div class="container hero__inner">
    <div class="hero__content">
      <p class="hero__tag"><span class="hero__tag-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{ c.hero.eyebrow | safe }}</p>
      <h1 class="hero__title" id="hero-title">{{ c.hero.title | safe }}</h1>
      <p class="hero__lead">{{ c.hero.lead | safe }}</p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        {{ button(c.hero.cta or c.ui.cta, "#" + c.form.id, { size: "lg", variant: "on-dark", icon: "arrow-right", class: "hero__cta", short: c.ui.ctaShort }) }}
        {{ button(site.company.phone, "tel:" + site.company.phoneHref, { size: "lg", variant: "glass", icon: "phone", class: "hero__phone", attrs: 'aria-label="' + (c.ui.phoneLabel | plain) + ' ' + site.company.phone + '"' }) }}
      </div>
    </div>

    {% include "partials/proof-strip.njk" %}
  </div>

  {%- if variant == "video" %}
  <div class="hero__video-ui">
    {%- if c.hero.video.placeholder %}<p class="hero__placeholder">{{ c.ui.video.placeholder | safe }}</p>{% endif %}
    <button class="hero__pause" type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-hero-pause data-label-pause="{{ c.ui.video.pause | plain }}" data-label-play="{{ c.ui.video.play | plain }}" aria-label="{{ c.ui.video.pause | plain }}" hidden>
      {% icon "pause", "hero__pause-icon hero__pause-icon--pause" %}{% icon "play", "hero__pause-icon hero__pause-icon--play" %}
    </button>
  </div>
  {%- endif %}
</section>
